 "name_en": "Receivables Financing with Taulia (7DX)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Receivables Financing with Taulia (7DX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe390830ea11c4471a714b7bb1303659c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe390830ea11c4471a714b7bb1303659c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Taulia Receivables Financing gives you the ability to finance your receivable invoices with a diverse network of funders directly through the Taulia platform. You’ll gain unparalleled flexibility with the ability to finance individual invoices as needed. The delivered automated reconciliation streamlines your processes with the end-to-end automated process from financing, to repayment to the funder.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Financing of invoices requires an agreement with Taulia.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe390830ea11c4471a714b7bb1303659c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Replicate customer master and receivables transaction data to Taulia platform automatically</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use Taulia to analyze your customer master and receivable invoices to provide the most competitive financing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use Taulia to provide indicative pricing for financing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enter into an agreement with Taulia to start financing of selected invoices</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Select specific or all invoices for financing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Record and post financing documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post repayment documents automatically</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe390830ea11c4471a714b7bb1303659c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve your liquidity by converting receivables to cash faster, supporting growth initiatives</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Diversify funding sources through a multi-funder approach to mitigate risk</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve operational efficiency by reducing manual workload with our automated reconciliation</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>通过 Taulia 的应收账款融资 (7DX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe390830ea11c4471a714b7bb1303659c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe390830ea11c4471a714b7bb1303659c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Taulia Receivables Financing 使您能够直接通过 Taulia 平台通过各种出资人网络为应收账款发票融资。您将获得无与伦比的灵活性，并能够根据需要为单个发票融资。提供的自动对账通过端到端自动化流程（从融资到还款到出资人）简化您的流程。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">发票融资需要与 Taulia 达成协议。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe390830ea11c4471a714b7bb1303659c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">自动将客户主数据和应收账款交易数据复制到 Taulia 平台</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用 Taulia 分析您的客户主数据和应收账款发票，以提供最具竞争力的融资</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用 Taulia 为融资提供指示性定价</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">与 Taulia 签订协议，开始为所选发票融资</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">选择融资的特定或所有发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">记录和过账融资凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动过账还款凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe390830ea11c4471a714b7bb1303659c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">更快速地将应收账款转化为现金，提高资金流动性，支持业务增长计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过多出资方方法来减少风险，使资金来源多样化</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">借助我们的自动对账功能，减少手动工作量，提高运营效率</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
